<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8ds41b1-18a565837e4682f4ce454590d12afbc5" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-2" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-2" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-2" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-2" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>TheraLight 360 has been shown to be effective in managing various conditions, including:</p>
<ul>
<li data-pm-slice="0 0 []">Pain Management: Alleviates muscle and joint pain by increasing blood flow and reducing inflammation. ​</li>
<li>Skin Health: Improves the appearance of wrinkles, fine lines, age spots, and acne by stimulating collagen production. ​</li>
