<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8ds5na2-d724bad9d27a8f7eb73900938dbb7282" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-4" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-4" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-4" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-4" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>Yes, TheraLight 360 therapy is considered safe, non-toxic, and non-invasive, with no known negative side effects. Some users may experience a warming sensation due to increased circulation, but this is typically mild and temporary. Occasionally, clients might feel mild fatigue or discomfort after treatment, which usually subsides within 24 to 48 hours.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8ds7la3-9e6650de5d395b1839ca7ccdfe8ee4c2" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-5" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-5" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-5" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-5" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>TheraLight 360 therapy is suitable for individuals seeking to improve muscle performance, reduce pain and inflammation, enhance joint mobility, and promote overall wellness. It also benefits those looking to improve sleep patterns, mood, and skin health. However, individuals who are pregnant, have cancer, or have had organ transplants should consult with <a href="about-bankole-johnson.php">Dr. Johnson</a> before undergoing therapy.</p>
